#X text 11 5 Portamento refers to a smooth change in pitch between
two notes.;
#X text 12 40 If a note arrives and no previous note is on \, then
portamento will immediately send the note's corresponding frequency
to the outlet.;
#X text 12 88 If a note arrives and a previous note is on \, then portamento
will ramp from whatever frequency it is currently sending to the frequency
of the newest note.;
#X obj 194 696 f;
#X text 249 696 is a note playing? (0 \, 1);
#X obj 127 755 spigot;
